<headline>Goody's Family Clothing Q1 shr $0.30.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>GOODY'S FAMILY CLOTHING, INC.</p>
<p>		  Unaudited Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>		    (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						    Thirteen Weeks Ended</p>
<p>					    May 3, 1997     May 4, 1996</p>
<p> Sales					$ 190,057	 $ 150,766</p>
